{
  "version": 1,
  "partId": "pinball-entry-p2",
  "audioFile": "pinball-entry-part2.mp3",
  "durationSeconds": 429.518,
  "method": "whisper-local",
  "preambleSeconds": 115.35,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Section 2.",
      "start": 101.508,
      "end": 104.025,
      "preAudio": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You will hear a woman talking about her apartment.",
      "start": 104.025,
      "end": 115.35,
      "preAudio": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 16.",
      "start": 115.35,
      "end": 119.43,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now listen and answer questions 11 to 16.",
      "start": 119.43,
      "end": 122.15,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Hello everyone.",
      "start": 122.15,
      "end": 122.83,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Very few of us have the luxury of being able to live in a spacious home with breathtaking",
      "start": 122.83,
      "end": 128.95,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "views from the window and a vast garden to relax in.",
      "start": 128.95,
      "end": 130.49,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "More likely than not, you'll live somewhere like I do.",
      "start": 130.49,
      "end": 133.89
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "A nice apartment in a pretty good location, but a lot more cramped than I'd prefer it",
      "start": 133.89,
      "end": 139.67,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "with narrow corridors and not much room for anything other than essential furniture.",
      "start": 139.67,
      "end": 141.41,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But in this talk, I'd like to offer a few tips on making a small apartment feel as light",
      "start": 141.41,
      "end": 145.77,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and airy as possible.",
      "start": 145.77,
      "end": 147.13
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I'd like to show you this slide, which is a very simple plan of my own apartment.",
      "start": 147.13,
      "end": 152.31,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "As you can see, it's not too big, it's something like 40 square meters.",
      "start": 152.31,
      "end": 157.07,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But I've tried to make the most of it.",
      "start": 157.07,
      "end": 160.13,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "As you come in, you'll basically come into what is now my bedroom, but you probably won't",
      "start": 160.13,
      "end": 165.91,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "notice it because I've put a lovely secondhand piece of furniture there, stacked my books",
      "start": 165.91,
      "end": 171.01,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "on it, of course, along with some other things, and it totally blocks the view of my bed on",
      "start": 171.01,
      "end": 177.47,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "the left.",
      "start": 177.47,
      "end": 178.15
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It stretches most of the way up to the ceiling, and it basically creates a kind of wall.",
      "start": 178.15,
      "end": 184.27,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Apart from a sense of privacy, it also means I don't have to look at the door to the bathroom",
      "start": 184.27,
      "end": 191.07,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "while I'm in bed.",
      "start": 191.07,
      "end": 192.43,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So I've essentially created an extra corridor.",
      "start": 192.43,
      "end": 194.81,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I work from home occasionally, and I couldn't think of where I'd put a large desk, so what",
      "start": 194.81,
      "end": 200.93,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I've done instead is install a folding one on the wall, which lifts up whenever I'm not",
      "start": 200.93,
      "end": 206.71,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "using it.",
      "start": 206.71,
      "end": 207.39
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-27",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's in front of the bed, and rather than a desk chair, I use a trunk to sit on whenever",
      "start": 207.39,
      "end": 214.19,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-28",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I'm working.",
      "start": 214.19,
      "end": 214.87
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-29",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's permanently there in front of my desk.",
      "start": 214.87,
      "end": 217.59,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-30",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's okay as long as I'm not sitting on it for hours, and it's really useful for extra",
      "start": 217.59,
      "end": 223.71,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-31",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "storage too.",
      "start": 223.71,
      "end": 224.39
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-32",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "My kitchen area is in an awkward place.",
      "start": 224.39,
      "end": 227.11,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-33",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "As you come right from the bedroom area, and towards what I call the living room area,",
      "start": 227.11,
      "end": 232.89,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-34",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "there's certainly no room for tables or chairs there, which is why I often have breakfast",
      "start": 232.89,
      "end": 238.33,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "standing up.",
      "start": 238.33,
      "end": 239.01,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-36",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Then there's the balcony, where I have managed to put some chairs and a table.",
      "start": 239.01,
      "end": 244.11,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-37",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's quite a big amount of space, and good for sitting and having a meal with one or two",
      "start": 244.11,
      "end": 250.57,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-38",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "friends when the weather's okay.",
      "start": 250.57,
      "end": 252.27,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-39",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "All I have in the living room area at the moment is an armchair.",
      "start": 252.27,
      "end": 257.03,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-40",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "There's actually room for a small table and a lamp, and I'd like to add those later.",
      "start": 257.03,
      "end": 262.81,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-41",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I don't think there's any need for a sofa when it's just me living there.",
      "start": 262.81,
      "end": 267.91,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-42",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Before you listen to the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 17-20.",
      "start": 267.91,
      "end": 274.03,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-43",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now listen, and answer questions 17-20.",
      "start": 274.03,
      "end": 276.07
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-44",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "First of all, don't spend your time wishing that you had a separate room for an office or",
      "start": 276.07,
      "end": 278.63,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-45",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "whatever.",
      "start": 278.63,
      "end": 279.08,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-46",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's perfectly easy to turn a single room into different zones.",
      "start": 279.08,
      "end": 280.78,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-47",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "This is what I did with my bedroom, which now has a corridor, a sleeping area, and a working",
      "start": 280.78,
      "end": 285.913,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-48",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "area.",
      "start": 285.913,
      "end": 286.363,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-49",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You don't need to use a large bookshelf to achieve this, though.",
      "start": 286.363,
      "end": 287.92,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-50",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Some large plants may work well to split up an area, or even some well-placed rugs in",
      "start": 287.92,
      "end": 293.28,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-51",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "different colors if you want to make things feel warm and cozy.",
      "start": 293.28,
      "end": 297.27
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-52",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Another trick, which always works well, is to use mirrors to create the illusion of depth.",
      "start": 297.27,
      "end": 302.71,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-53",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I have quite a big one in my bathroom, which really helps.",
      "start": 302.71,
      "end": 309.07,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-54",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "There are some places where it would be a terrible idea to place one, of course, like right",
      "start": 309.07,
      "end": 315.19,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-55",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "in front of where you sleep.",
      "start": 315.19,
      "end": 317.23,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-56",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "However, pictures and mirrors achieve the same effect.",
      "start": 317.23,
      "end": 319.95,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-57",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I have a poster in front of my entrance door, which is the first thing I see when I come",
      "start": 319.95,
      "end": 326.75,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-58",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "home.",
      "start": 326.75,
      "end": 327.2,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-59",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Another good trick is to avoid placing your furniture, especially things like sofas, large",
      "start": 327.2,
      "end": 331.33,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-60",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "tables, or beds, so that it goes right up against the walls.",
      "start": 331.33,
      "end": 335.93,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-61",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It can actually give a much more spacious feeling if furniture kind of floats in the middle",
      "start": 335.93,
      "end": 342.75,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-62",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "of a room.",
      "start": 342.75,
      "end": 344.15,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-63",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And while I'm on the topic of furniture, choose the style carefully.",
      "start": 344.15,
      "end": 350.03,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-64",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Glass can be an interesting material for things like tables.",
      "start": 350.03,
      "end": 354.85,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-65",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The one in my living room area is made from this, and looks a lot more airy than something",
      "start": 354.85,
      "end": 361.31,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-66",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "made of heavy looking wood or metal.",
      "start": 361.31,
      "end": 364.49,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-67",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Similarly, my balcony tables and chairs, which are actually made from wood, can fold up and",
      "start": 364.49,
      "end": 372.51,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-68",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "be put aside when I'm not using them.",
      "start": 372.51,
      "end": 376.65,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-69",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Finally, and this might seem like another obvious point, but it's an important one.",
      "start": 376.65,
      "end": 383.81,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-70",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "If you have the choice of painting the walls, don't try and be too creative when it comes",
      "start": 383.81,
      "end": 389.93,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-71",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "to lots of interesting, exciting colors.",
      "start": 389.93,
      "end": 393.41,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-72",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Go for lighter, neutral colors instead.",
      "start": 393.41,
      "end": 397.29,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-73",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Otherwise, you'll really make your place seem a lot darker and smaller than it needs",
      "start": 397.29,
      "end": 403.29,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-74",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "to be.",
      "start": 403.29,
      "end": 404.29,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-75",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "This is especially so with ceilings, which always seem to be a bit further away the paler",
      "start": 404.29,
      "end": 411.07,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-76",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "they are, so choosing the right color for those is a must.",
      "start": 411.07,
      "end": 416.13,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-77",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Thank you for listening.",
      "start": 416.13,
      "end": 417.75,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-78",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now if you've got any questions or even tips of your own, then I'd be pleased to...",
      "start": 417.75,
      "end": 425.81,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-79",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That is the end of section 2.",
      "start": 425.81,
      "end": 429.518,
      "preAudio": false
    }
  ]
}
